{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0413_1000_null", "source_sha256": "0339e150539e9fe9d0e8ddd5a189ddae559055905468e231d9c4b44dd09c80ab", "ja": "番組収録の数日前……", "zh": "节目录制的几天前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0413_1001_401pro", "source_sha256": "b2c7ddac916ae1efc371a8d35ab07ac9643910529e55d29248ad242f5141807f", "ja": "ん？　まだ誰か残ってるみたいだな。\nあれは……。", "zh": "嗯？好像还有谁没走。\n那是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0413_1002_null", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0413_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "38bf512b5071eedfec7eddca43012c749a2d4cd8f87e956054a1f81144899320", "ja": "あ、お疲れさまです、プロデューサー。\nちょうどよかった、一緒に見てもらえませんか？", "zh": "啊，辛苦了，制作人。\n你来得正好，能陪我一起看看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0413_1004_401pro", "source_sha256": "4b16856b16fa18353d371f6f38f84d1cb7f7f0dc8709c1f380b0a8e867de3d82", "ja": "えっと……、うん、構わないけど。\nその動画、今日のダンスレッスンか？", "zh": "呃……嗯，可以啊。\n那段视频是今天的舞蹈课吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0413_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "14bc8494237a1c8778160b09ed2e9e250177a152dcad5830b3544efd31a02051", "ja": "はい。番組での収録に備えて、チェックしてるんです。\n今日は本番想定で踊ったので。", "zh": "是的。为了准备节目的录制，我正在检查。\n因为今天是按照正式演出的情况来跳的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0413_1006_401pro", "source_sha256": "936259ce6bff3951a5ae1fb8de967b0906531db047c05f925fbf6f88da2d4030", "ja": "そっか。それでその衣装……。", "zh": "这样啊，所以才穿那套服装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0413_1007_017kth", "source_sha256": "2437de5bae1068fc85b086c8c8ab9239db3b8af55022df3c71c8e8a4cb811db2", "ja": "環ちゃんは動きが大きくて、小さいのに目立ちます。\n百合子ちゃんの表情には表現力があって……。", "zh": "环的动作幅度很大，明明个子小却很显眼。\n百合子的表情很有表现力……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0413_1008_017kth", "source_sha256": "ce2d1e16b750c15fe6712b55106f4d3191d7a5bdde27faa3883dd3084deb0f01", "ja": "あ、私の今のターン、もう少し大きい方が\nいいですよね。こうやって……。", "zh": "啊，我刚才的动作幅度再大一点比较好，对吧？像这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0413_1009_017kth", "source_sha256": "6e44c2b494be2a0b3eabbc5fafb4fbba3439567e1436072612e7cfb378934a24", "ja": "あれっ？　私、衣装のまま……？\nす、すみません！　本番で使うのに、すぐ脱がなきゃ！", "zh": "哎呀？我怎么还穿着演出服……？\n对、对不起！这可是正式演出要用的，得赶快脱下来才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0413_1010_401pro", "source_sha256": "e86ba18a30b160d1167754553c2818117d7ec847d80d33b8dd2d92f0a531650c", "ja": "いやいいから！　動きやすさまで確認してもらえて、\n助かったよ。大丈夫だったか？", "zh": "没事没事！连行动起来是否方便都帮忙确认过了，真是帮大忙了。没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0413_1011_017kth", "source_sha256": "001630e07e82ce0dc001eb36c4c323411c1029c6b1833c77dc5865068564309a", "ja": "……。は、はい……。", "zh": "……。是、是的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0413_1012_401pro", "source_sha256": "f2a4470c4f75564c95b02105e69e20b379d98eda60b6bb1f78fd66be95144a68", "ja": "？　なんか、歯切れ悪いけど……？", "zh": "？怎么感觉你说话吞吞吐吐的……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0413_1013_017kth", "source_sha256": "a18cff234f0893df8dc573d358460fdd472cbbded5727080ddff356b4d5e4c77", "ja": "ごめんなさい！　本当はみんなで衣装を合わせた後、\n脱ぐのがもったいなくて……ずっと……。", "zh": "对不起！其实是因为大家换好服装后，\n觉得脱下来太可惜了……所以一直……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0413_1014_017kth", "source_sha256": "66fe1f1ade547ec684feea84bd9aa76f146a27048a78612ee2c65d35e42a48c3", "ja": "それで帰る前に、ちょっと踊ってみたくなって……\nちょっとだけなんです！", "zh": "所以在回去之前，就有点想跳一下……\n真的只跳了一小会儿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0413_1015_401pro", "source_sha256": "a39f5d2012487ca02dd5a88afa67d3027aa0fc681b139d7be8d8dd551754b8a6", "ja": "……それで踊ってみたら、\n今度はダンス自体が気になり始めたって感じか。", "zh": "……所以试着跳了跳之后，就开始对舞蹈本身感兴趣了，是这种感觉吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0413_1016_017kth", "source_sha256": "15d66e86750e8974627c954683d54c7b1661295c44c875929b6a1ce25e00f90d", "ja": "は、はい……。本当にごめんなさい！　もし傷でも\nついてたらどうしよう……弁償ってできますか！？", "zh": "是、是的……真的非常抱歉！要是留下什么伤痕的话，该怎么办……我能赔偿吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0413_1017_401pro", "source_sha256": "d736b3d1ab4d087c8a488d066b0a924a1a2634d379d784bd4d4dfad09b681bcd", "ja": "ついてないから大丈夫！\nむしろ、ちょっと安心したよ。", "zh": "没有碰伤，所以没关系！\n倒不如说，我反而松了口气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0413_1018_017kth", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0413_1019_401pro", "source_sha256": "d9ba33f2734aa9b7287f855378e3ea0ba19eb0cac4cfb8589cda13f6c332542e", "ja": "テレビに出るからって張りきるのはいいけど、\n根を詰め過ぎないか、心配してたんだ。", "zh": "虽然因为要上电视而干劲十足是好事，但我还是担心你会不会太过拼命。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0413_1020_401pro", "source_sha256": "c049a38f07b60a506eb8ed90343a9a229207ffe82d0280058439fc64dc8ca462", "ja": "だから、衣装を着て喜ぶくらいの、純粋な憧れとか。\nそういう気持ちは、大事にしていいと思う。", "zh": "所以，那种仅仅因为穿上服装就感到开心的纯粹憧憬。这样的心情，我觉得应该好好珍惜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0413_1021_017kth", "source_sha256": "edba5ed3c1d619de6a4c067a29c4d8dac6eadf62877e4a1bac02eb1da05570a7", "ja": "純粋な、憧れ……。", "zh": "纯粹的憧憬……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0413_1022_401pro", "source_sha256": "f36c18b0970ebe91abdd885b91fd17b51173ad559ac3ccac397f1226a42bae20", "ja": "うん、しかもよく似合ってるし！\nあ、写真撮ろうか？　誰か見せたい人、いるよな？", "zh": "嗯，而且很适合你！\n啊，要拍张照片吗？你有想给谁看的人吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0413_1023_017kth", "source_sha256": "09cb5f009d35c814af0aa6c7a56be387e61347573c2ca97efbab372a973174d8", "ja": "……はい。じゃあ、あの……\nあ！　やっぱり、いいです。", "zh": "……嗯。那，那个……\n啊！还是，算了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0413_1024_401pro", "source_sha256": "6def1dc9115bf9520b3223d2e996714864fe8b0ecd7b32da99905de62e928c56", "ja": "？　どうした？　写真の腕なら、そんなに悪くないと\n思うんだけど……あ、でも早坂さんの方がいいか？", "zh": "？怎么了？我觉得我的拍照技术也没那么差吧……啊，不过还是早坂小姐更好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0413_1025_017kth", "source_sha256": "05e259a0351747b3a181a7b51ea1d44272c2634c6022439c480af5b8c3d481f3", "ja": "そうじゃなくて。これ、Team3rdの衣装なので。\n最初の写真は、みんなと一緒に。", "zh": "不是那个意思。这是Team3rd的服装。所以第一张照片，要和大家一起拍。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0413_1026_401pro", "source_sha256": "43b33c61af1b39a4c197dd84c2ed118e8211dd7c959e5de8f165369c3d8b5b76", "ja": "……なるほど。\nうん、それじゃ、また今度にするか！", "zh": "……原来如此。\n嗯，那就下次再说吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_017kth0413_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_017kth0413_1027_017kth", "source_sha256": "bc1e3e3cc4aaf80919208890aa23052f1836b9c1c9e61dd74fec100b16d828a8", "ja": "すみません。でも、今度みんながいる時には、\n絶対お願いします！", "zh": "对不起。不过，下次大家都在的时候，请一定要答应我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
